| `clipboard` copies in a browser, and this is not one. `Copy` answers an
| Exception rather than pretending — a program that copied into nothing
| would tell its reader the text was kept when it was not.
|
| The module is linkable here anyway, so one application can be built both
| ways and ask `Linked` which it is. The half that can actually copy is a
| `.a` linked into a `--target wasm` build; nothing in this suite is one.

link "native_modules/clipboard.so" as clip

emit Copy { text = "hi" } to clip get r
assert r ∈ Exception
assert r.source = "clipboard"

| A class it does not handle is null, not an error.
emit Whatever {} to clip get other
assert other = null
